# SQLite database directories. Anchored on purpose: an unanchored `data/` also
# swallowed source folders such as frontend/src/data/, silently keeping generated
# modules out of the repository. The runtime default is backend/data (see
# DATA_DIR in backend/src/db/database.ts); /data/ covers a custom DATA_DIR.
